{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CfruzgBefcobe2FLtxUuU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The resolver failure now names the package that required the broken dependency, so the ticket's case reads \"vllm requires flashinfer-python==…\" instead of pointing at `its-hub`. The bootstrapper tests pass (45/45), including two new regression tests.\n\n**Root cause:** Resolution for a dependency runs in a background thread (`_bg_resolve` in `src/fromager/bootstrapper/_resolve.py`). When the resolver fails, the error only names the failing requirement. The top-level handler then prefixes it with whatever package is in the logging context (`its-hub`), so the cause is lost.\n\n**Fix** (`src/fromager/bootstrapper/_resolve.py`):\n- `_bg_resolve` catches `ResolverException` and re-raises it as `\"{parent} requires {req}, which cannot be resolved: {err}\"`, chained with `from err`.\n- With no parent (a top-level requirement), the original error is re-raised unchanged.\n\n**Tests** (`tests/test_bootstrapper.py`):\n- `test_bg_resolve_failure_names_broken_parent` checks the message names `vllm` and keeps the original error as the cause.\n- `test_bg_resolve_top_level_failure_is_unchanged` checks the top-level path is untouched.\n\n**Choices and limits:**\n- I named only the immediate parent (`vllm` in the ticket's chain). The full chain, `its-hub -> reward-hub -> vllm`, is available as `Bootstrapper.explain`, but the background thread is not allowed to touch bootstrapper state. Surfacing the full chain would mean catching the error in the main thread (`Resolve.run`). I didn't do that.\n- `ENABLE_REPEATABLE_BUILD_MODE` does not appear anywhere in `src/`. I couldn't confirm the ticket's exact mode, so the fix applies to all dependency resolution, not just that mode.\n- `ruff` is not installed in `.venv`, so I could not run lint or format checks. I also did not run the full test suite.\n- Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5047,"cache_read_input_tokens":100366,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5047},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b7fd63d-eb2a-4732-b860-3fa8e7b58790","uuid":"a62cf0a9-816d-4635-80f8-2b926f928621","timestamp":"2026-10-09T15:39:32.855Z","request_id":"req_011CfruzfrYen8G9bDS8DpwD"}
